Function get_db_session:
- pull session_factory from request.app.state
- yield a managed SQLAlchemy Session per request

Service getter functions:
- expose StorageService, AuthService, DataVersionService, CatalogService, SessionService
- expose CacheService, LeaderboardService, EventStreamService, MetricsService, BenchmarkService
- expose AIRunService and AdminJobService from app.state

Function get_current_user:
- decode backend bearer token and set request.state.user_id when authentication succeeds

Function get_required_user:
- enforce authenticated access for protected routes

Function get_admin_user:
- validate HTTP Basic credentials against ADMIN_USERNAME and ADMIN_PASSWORD
